  "description": "Straight teal posts at each end hold the two seats of the Double Post Swing. The upright design is simple and sturdy, and it lines up neatly against a boundary or alongside other equipment. It suits the 6 to 12 years Key User Group and seats two children. The product area is 9'4\" x 3'2\" and the safe play area 11'4\" x 13'3\". Schools often like a straight-post frame because it is easy to supervise from one side. It comes in Horizon Teal. Our warranty covers galvanised pipes for 3 years and bearings and spare parts for 1 year, against manufacturing defects. Share the size of your play area and we will draw it into a layout.",
